Z||000002||stimpy||06-07-2001||09:23 AM||||It's taken getting my stereo and all my CD's stolen TWICE to get a clue and never leave that stuff in the car. Faceplates are removable for a reason. Even if you just stuff it under the seat you are better off then leasving it in plain view.<P>Oh well,lecture over. That really sucks. My heart goes out. If you still have your receipt, you may be able to get the faceplate replaced from the manufacturer. ||||reg||1
